It calls getUserByID() in internal/user/service.go:42, see L42-58. The HTTPServer reads MAX_RETRIES from user_id, e.g. 3.5 seconds, then std::sync takes over and `redis` -> postgres. The APIs and IDs stay as written. Open tcp.go:88-95 and handler.go:L12; we meet at 12:30, not 9:05 or 7:00 PM, on localhost:8080.
